#: slot/0x00420130/0x8f1ffa/0x000001
msgid "I have a girlfriend and I visit her every now and then..."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00420130/0x8f207a/0x000000
msgid "Your... snoring keeps me up at night, Boss..."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00420130/0x8f2bfa/0x000000
#: slot/0x00420130/0x8f2d7a/0x000000
msgid "To be honest, I..."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00420130/0x8f2bfa/0x000001
msgid "prefer colder climates..."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00420130/0x8f2c7a/0x000000
msgid "I'm sorry, I..."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00420130/0x8f2c7a/0x000001
msgid "I actually kinda prefer hunting to this..."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00420130/0x8f2cfa/0x000000
msgid "Forgive me..."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00420130/0x8f2cfa/0x000001
msgid "I have a test tomorrow, and..."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00420130/0x8f2cfa/0x000002
msgid "I really should be studying for it..."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00420130/0x8f2d7a/0x000001
msgid "I... didn't know much about you, Boss."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00420130/0x8f2d7a/0x000002
msgid "Action games... aren't my thing..."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00420130/0x8f2dfa/0x000000
msgid "I'm just getting started, and... "
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00420130/0x8f2dfa/0x000001
msgid "honestly I don't know if I can get the hang of it..."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00420130/0x8f2ffa/0x000000
msgid "Wha?"
msgstr ""

